WEBVTT

01:39.520 --> 01:41.940
I've had so many dreams.

01:42.900 --> 01:45.840
Like I was living
in different parallel universes.

01:45.880 --> 01:47.960
Each universe had its version of you.

01:49.920 --> 01:52.180
Every version of you ended up
with a different fate.

01:58.380 --> 02:00.040
In any of those universes…

02:03.000 --> 02:04.540
you probably never imagined

02:06.500 --> 02:08.240
I'd end up like this.

02:39.000 --> 02:39.840
Do you know

02:39.880 --> 02:41.660
what I see

02:43.160 --> 02:44.660
when I look at you now?

02:48.440 --> 02:49.620
You are safe.

02:51.560 --> 02:54.260
A little tanner, but honestly?
You look healthier.

02:56.600 --> 02:58.060
You've got a roof over your head.

02:59.080 --> 03:00.580
You've got someone to talk to.

03:01.080 --> 03:02.840
And you've been thinking about me.

03:06.820 --> 03:09.380
That's already the best ending
out of all my dreams.

03:13.260 --> 03:15.000
Do you know what kind of dreams I had?

03:15.040 --> 03:17.140
I dreamed you got shot.

03:18.480 --> 03:19.900
You were robbed.

03:22.060 --> 03:23.180
Jiang Qiaoxi,

03:23.680 --> 03:25.400
if you were me,

03:25.440 --> 03:27.280
after our talk that night,

03:27.320 --> 03:29.220
I just disappeared.

03:29.260 --> 03:30.580
No calls. No messages.

03:32.200 --> 03:33.540
what would you have thought?

03:42.120 --> 03:43.740
I'd probably think

03:48.880 --> 03:51.000
Yingtao must be doing great.

03:52.840 --> 03:54.180
At the very least,

03:54.720 --> 03:56.160
she wouldn't be stuck

03:56.740 --> 03:57.840
the way I am now.

04:03.160 --> 04:04.340
Liar.

04:55.020 --> 04:55.940
I'm not leaving.

04:58.280 --> 05:00.600
I meant it. I'm staying, Jiang Qiaoxi.

05:40.980 --> 05:41.840
Hey,

05:41.880 --> 05:43.660
do me a favor.

05:43.700 --> 05:45.040
When she wakes up tomorrow,

05:45.080 --> 05:46.440
grab her some breakfast from that

05:46.480 --> 05:47.960
shrimp dumpling place around the corner.

05:48.000 --> 05:49.400
Pretty sure she'd like it.

05:50.660 --> 05:51.780
Why don't you do it?

05:52.700 --> 05:53.720
Come on, I'm asking you.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.120
Okay.

05:57.080 --> 05:57.920
Hey.

05:57.960 --> 05:59.100
Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:01.700 --> 06:03.300
She came all this way. What are you doing?

06:09.680 --> 06:10.840
Where are you going?

06:12.180 --> 06:13.900
Gotta hit the site for one more shift.

06:17.760 --> 06:18.660
Are you insane?

06:19.640 --> 06:21.760
Got the energy to work but not to stay?

06:21.800 --> 06:23.360
Your girlfriend's literally right there…

06:30.020 --> 06:31.040
Hey!

06:33.720 --> 06:35.280
Not coming back tonight?

06:38.040 --> 06:38.980
This guy…

06:39.020 --> 06:41.060
You two doing Reunion at the Nunnery now?

06:42.480 --> 06:44.860
Same as Princess Changping,
who hid and became a nun for years.

06:45.960 --> 06:48.780
Her Consort Zhou shows up and finds her,
but the Princess runs away.

09:53.580 --> 09:54.640
Hey, Du Shang.

09:55.260 --> 09:56.280
Yingtao.

09:56.860 --> 09:57.940
Did I wake you?

09:59.160 --> 10:00.340
No, not at all.

10:01.980 --> 10:03.200
Hey…

10:06.560 --> 10:07.700
I'm, um,

10:08.440 --> 10:09.820
in Hong Kong.

10:10.400 --> 10:11.740
I found Jiang Qiaoxi.

10:14.980 --> 10:16.140
That's great.

10:16.180 --> 10:18.380
I called because I thought
you should know.

10:19.060 --> 10:20.200
Earlier,

10:20.240 --> 10:22.420
Cai Fangyuan saw a photo
of Jiang QIaoxi online

10:22.460 --> 10:24.200
on his MSN Space.

10:24.240 --> 10:26.340
He was tutoring there in Hong Kong.

10:26.380 --> 10:27.960
Only a few of us saw it.

10:29.060 --> 10:31.280
But Qin Yeyun said…

10:32.020 --> 10:33.100
So I didn't…

10:33.140 --> 10:35.680
I kept thinking about it for days.

10:35.720 --> 10:37.200
Eventually, I talked to Cai Fangyuan,

10:37.700 --> 10:39.100
and we agreed you should know.

10:44.340 --> 10:45.640
It's okay.

10:45.680 --> 10:48.440
I get where Qin Yeyun was coming from.

10:49.440 --> 10:50.860
She meant well.

10:52.520 --> 10:53.740
Where is Jiang Qiaoxi?

10:53.780 --> 10:54.780
How is he?

11:04.620 --> 11:05.820
He…

11:07.080 --> 11:07.920
Not great.

11:10.600 --> 11:11.700
But now that you're there,

11:12.540 --> 11:14.020
I'm sure he'll be okay.

11:14.740 --> 11:16.440
You're his heroine, you know.

11:22.040 --> 11:23.180
You're right.

11:23.780 --> 11:24.940
Alright, I'll let you go.

11:24.980 --> 11:26.540
Call me if anything comes up.

11:26.580 --> 11:28.460
I will. Bye.

11:45.760 --> 11:47.080
Where are you?

11:49.060 --> 11:50.280
Thank you.

12:23.300 --> 12:24.560
Had breakfast yet?

12:24.600 --> 12:26.480
Jiang Qiaoxi asked me
to bring this for you.

12:26.520 --> 12:27.760
He'll pay me later.

12:38.240 --> 12:40.080
- Thanks.
- No problem at all.

12:41.960 --> 12:43.160
Thank you.

13:04.740 --> 13:06.760
Well…

13:06.800 --> 13:08.560
Have you booked a hotel yet?

13:08.600 --> 13:11.200
I can take you over after breakfast.

13:11.740 --> 13:13.680
If not, I can help you find one.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.940
I get discounts.

13:17.720 --> 13:19.860
I know you're here for Vincent.

13:19.900 --> 13:21.580
Don't worry.

13:21.620 --> 13:22.920
Just give me your number.

13:22.960 --> 13:25.060
I'll call you as soon as he's back.

13:28.220 --> 13:29.200
Hello?

13:30.860 --> 13:31.840
I'm not leaving.

13:32.540 --> 13:34.400
Jaing Qiaoxi didn't come home last night.

13:34.440 --> 13:37.200
Even if he really plans to leave for good,

13:37.700 --> 13:39.900
he'll have to come back
for his ID and his luggage.

13:39.940 --> 13:42.000
So I'm staying.
Don't try to talk me out of it.

13:42.040 --> 13:43.760
Leave? That's not gonna happen.

13:43.800 --> 13:44.860
He's not leaving.

13:44.900 --> 13:47.940
If he could've, he would've already.

13:47.980 --> 13:49.100
You go on ahead and check in.

13:49.140 --> 13:51.400
I'm not leaving.
Don't talk me into anything on his behalf.

13:51.440 --> 13:52.560
Thanks.

13:59.440 --> 14:00.540
Alright, how about this.

14:00.580 --> 14:02.120
You finish breakfast,

14:02.160 --> 14:04.440
I'll tell you which nunnery
Princess Changping's hiding in.

14:04.480 --> 14:06.060
Then we'll go catch your runaway princess.

14:16.920 --> 14:18.220
You know where he is?

14:19.240 --> 14:20.100
I'll take you there.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.240
Just give me a second.

14:27.860 --> 14:29.000
Honestly,

14:29.500 --> 14:30.620
you don't have to worry.

14:30.660 --> 14:32.980
He slept in the site shack last night.

14:34.060 --> 14:35.100
Site shack?

14:35.600 --> 14:38.240
What do you call these site guys?

14:39.180 --> 14:40.360
You know, the builders.

14:43.940 --> 14:46.160
You mean Jiang Qiaoxi
is working at construction sites?

14:46.200 --> 14:47.100
Yep.

14:47.140 --> 14:49.740
Pays well by the hour, flexible schedule.

14:50.420 --> 14:52.400
He's broke, no degree, no time.

14:52.440 --> 14:55.420
Plus, the work permit is easy to get.
Perfect fit for him.

14:56.740 --> 14:58.200
But didn't he go to university?

14:58.700 --> 15:00.340
Didn't he take TOEFL or something?

15:00.380 --> 15:02.220
No no, he's a student at HKU.

15:02.260 --> 15:03.360
Top of his class.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.080
Okay, he's at HKU.

15:07.660 --> 15:09.760
Even builders have to be HKU students?

15:09.800 --> 15:11.760
Not exactly.

15:11.800 --> 15:12.780
But

15:12.820 --> 15:14.580
they don't stop students

15:14.620 --> 15:15.720
from doing that stuff.

15:15.760 --> 15:18.480
If you're willing to do overtime,
you can make fifty, sixty thousand

15:18.520 --> 15:19.500
a month.

15:19.540 --> 15:20.740
That much?

15:23.840 --> 15:25.780
What kind of money is he trying to make?

15:35.620 --> 15:37.400
Honestly, even construction isn't enough.

15:37.440 --> 15:38.840
He's tutoring on top of it.

15:39.340 --> 15:41.580
Best job he's ever had, actually.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.640
But to do it,

15:43.680 --> 15:46.100
he has to cross the border to Shenzhen.

15:47.360 --> 15:48.720
Shenzhen?

15:49.440 --> 15:50.580
That's a lot of hassle.

15:51.180 --> 15:52.680
Yeah, it's a hassle, but sometimes

15:53.420 --> 15:54.920
something good comes out of it.

15:55.460 --> 15:56.680
Like what?

15:57.540 --> 15:59.180
Me, obviously.

16:00.340 --> 16:02.160
He's good at math,
so he manages my finances.

16:02.200 --> 16:03.440
Made me a good bit of money,

16:03.940 --> 16:05.720
so I gave him a break on rent.

16:06.220 --> 16:08.060
Even let him live in the biggest unit

16:08.100 --> 16:09.060
in the building.

16:09.100 --> 16:11.460
Otherwise, how could he save anything?

16:11.960 --> 16:14.020
Hong Kong rent'll bleed you dry.

16:15.200 --> 16:17.100
He lives in

16:17.140 --> 16:18.400
the biggest room?

16:19.020 --> 16:19.880
Yeah.

16:22.820 --> 16:24.060
How'd things get so hard for him.

16:24.560 --> 16:26.020
You know,

16:26.060 --> 16:27.320
I always thought

16:27.360 --> 16:29.600
that photo of you in his room was made up.

16:29.640 --> 16:32.080
Figured he imagined you or something.

16:32.120 --> 16:33.400
I mean,

16:33.440 --> 16:35.160
he never seemed quite right.

16:35.200 --> 16:37.180
Then I saw you for real and thought, whoa.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.360
Almost had a heart attack.

16:40.400 --> 16:41.940
You do exist.

16:47.340 --> 16:48.480
Yin.

16:48.980 --> 16:51.460
He's been tutoring,

16:51.500 --> 16:53.220
working construction,

16:53.260 --> 16:55.400
and you even cut his rent.

16:55.440 --> 16:57.960
Do you actually know
what he's saving up for?

17:01.080 --> 17:04.920
Sometimes people would rather
spill everything to strangers

17:05.760 --> 17:08.300
than say a single word
to someone they care about.

17:09.920 --> 17:11.079
You'll have to ask him.

17:11.579 --> 17:12.480
I can't talk about it.

17:42.440 --> 17:45.220
That's where he's working now.

17:45.260 --> 17:48.540
POLICE STATION

18:09.100 --> 18:09.940
Jiang Qiaoxi!

18:42.180 --> 18:43.340
Jiang Qiaoxi…

18:45.140 --> 18:46.440
Hey, wait.

18:46.480 --> 18:48.240
What's going on, miss?

18:49.760 --> 18:50.620
Anything we can do?

18:50.660 --> 18:52.480
Don't walk away, Jiang Qiaoxi. I saw you!

18:53.560 --> 18:54.660
Jiang Qiaoxi.

18:57.060 --> 18:58.700
Jiang Qiaoxi!

19:03.380 --> 19:04.720
Jiang Qiaoxi!

19:26.680 --> 19:27.980
Stop running!

19:30.140 --> 19:31.340
Stop running!

19:32.000 --> 19:34.600
Please. Stop running.

19:45.500 --> 19:46.720
Jiang Qiaoxi…

19:51.660 --> 19:53.320
- Yingtao!
- Stop him!

19:53.360 --> 19:54.720
Don't let him run away.

19:55.620 --> 19:57.480
- Yingtao…
- Don't move.

19:58.540 --> 20:00.100
- Miss.
- Let go!

20:00.140 --> 20:01.940
Don't move. Miss, are you alright?

20:01.980 --> 20:03.360
- Let go!
- Don't move.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.400
- Please.
- He stole something from you?

20:04.940 --> 20:05.840
- No…
- Guys,

20:06.580 --> 20:08.080
- We are good. Let go.
- don't hurt him.

20:08.120 --> 20:09.240
Don't move!

20:09.740 --> 20:10.720
What happened?

20:10.760 --> 20:11.720
No.

20:12.400 --> 20:14.380
- Did he steal anything?
- He's my friend.

20:15.080 --> 20:16.340
Hey!

20:16.380 --> 20:18.440
Please don't hurt him.

20:19.020 --> 20:21.120
- Sorry, he's a friend.
- You alright?

20:21.620 --> 20:23.880
Get a room, lovebirds.

20:23.920 --> 20:25.540
Man, you really spoil her.

20:27.080 --> 20:28.520
- It's okay.
- Stop running.

20:30.260 --> 20:32.060
- What's wrong?
- Stop running, Jiang Qiaoxi.

20:34.960 --> 20:36.940
Please, I can't keep up.

20:37.700 --> 20:38.820
Jiang Qiaoxi.

20:42.040 --> 20:42.880
I can't…

20:47.920 --> 20:49.440
Come on, I'll take you to the hospital.

21:03.280 --> 21:05.000
Just don't…

21:06.560 --> 21:07.860
run again.

21:14.780 --> 21:16.480
Jiang Qiaoxi…

21:16.520 --> 21:18.860
Yingtao. Yingtao?

21:19.360 --> 21:20.820
Stop running.

21:22.200 --> 21:23.940
I'm right here. I'm not running.

21:26.180 --> 21:27.080
Careful.

21:29.600 --> 21:30.800
Don't run.

22:12.040 --> 22:15.280
Jiang Qiaoxi, look at those jellyfish
on TV. They're so pretty.

22:15.820 --> 22:17.100
Makes me want to eat take a bite.

22:17.140 --> 22:18.640
Probably taste amazing.

22:19.140 --> 22:22.340
You can't eat jellyfish.
Most of them are poisonous.

22:23.860 --> 22:26.020
No way. They're so pretty.

22:27.900 --> 22:29.140
Looks pretty, stings worse.

22:29.180 --> 22:30.280
Huh?

22:30.320 --> 22:32.340
Are you poisonous too, Jiang Qiaoxi?

22:33.620 --> 22:35.060
What are you doing?

22:35.560 --> 22:36.820
Jiang Qiaoxi,

22:36.860 --> 22:38.420
I think I've been poisoned by you.

22:38.460 --> 22:39.820
Help.

22:40.540 --> 22:41.700
Somebody help…

22:42.600 --> 22:43.820
Yingtao,

22:43.860 --> 22:45.040
do you like jellyfish?

22:45.960 --> 22:47.560
Let's go see them together someday.

22:49.440 --> 22:50.840
But there's no aquarium in Qunshan.

22:51.580 --> 22:52.740
There is in the city.

22:54.080 --> 22:55.680
But I don't like the city.

23:01.200 --> 23:02.420
Then we won't go.

23:05.100 --> 23:07.580
If you're there, I'll like it.

23:07.620 --> 23:09.040
Then we're definitely going.

23:15.360 --> 23:16.560
Yingtao,

23:16.600 --> 23:18.100
why aren't you doing your homework?

23:18.940 --> 23:20.200
Yours not done.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.760
Mine's not done either.

23:23.060 --> 23:25.140
Jiang Qiaoxi…

23:29.780 --> 23:33.380
How come your homework's still not done?

23:59.080 --> 24:00.360
Jiang Qiaoxi…

24:12.840 --> 24:13.760
Yingtao.

24:14.840 --> 24:16.040
Jiang Qiaoxi.

24:22.220 --> 24:24.180
You've grown so much.

24:26.440 --> 24:29.580
You were so small in my dream.

24:31.780 --> 24:33.880
Just this tiny little thing.

24:33.920 --> 24:35.140
Yingtao…

24:37.720 --> 24:38.980
We've both grown up.

24:46.540 --> 24:48.220
No serious issues.

24:48.260 --> 24:50.000
Just heat exhaustion, her body's worn out.

24:50.740 --> 24:53.320
You know how intense
the AC is in Hong Kong.

24:53.360 --> 24:55.180
It's not like back in Hongyang.

24:55.220 --> 24:57.460
Your girlfriend showed up dressed light,

24:57.500 --> 24:58.640
no jacket.

24:58.680 --> 25:00.140
She got overheated walking outside,

25:00.180 --> 25:02.680
then chilled to the bone
in the metro and indoors.

25:02.720 --> 25:04.520
That hot-and-cold swing took her out.

25:04.560 --> 25:05.920
And she mentioned

25:05.960 --> 25:07.420
she hasn't slept in a couple days.

25:07.460 --> 25:09.020
That added to it.

25:11.300 --> 25:13.540
Anyway, what matters now is rest.

25:14.160 --> 25:15.280
Thanks, doctor.

25:15.900 --> 25:17.220
Why'd you come out here?

25:17.260 --> 25:19.200
- Get back in.
- I came to find you.

25:24.060 --> 25:25.940
Go back in. You need to rest.

25:28.220 --> 25:29.900
I'm scared I'll wake up

25:30.960 --> 25:31.960
and you'll be gone.

25:42.360 --> 25:43.380
I won't leave.

25:43.880 --> 25:45.120
I'll be right here.

25:46.700 --> 25:47.820
Back to bed.

25:47.860 --> 25:49.660
You need to rest
if you want to get better.

25:51.280 --> 25:52.520
Yingtao.

25:55.120 --> 25:55.980
Yingtao.

25:56.880 --> 25:58.600
Take me home.

26:01.700 --> 26:03.800
I don't like how hospitals smell.

26:04.860 --> 26:06.340
Please take me back.

26:10.520 --> 26:12.340
My AC's still broken.

26:13.760 --> 26:16.040
It was the heat and cold
that made you sick.

26:16.080 --> 26:18.160
Going home will only make it worse.

26:18.660 --> 26:19.660
I'll use a blanket.

26:21.260 --> 26:23.260
I just don't want to stay here.

27:39.920 --> 27:41.060
Okay. Sit tight.

27:42.280 --> 27:43.580
Come on.

27:43.620 --> 27:44.740
I'll get a room.

27:50.200 --> 27:51.420
Sir,

27:51.460 --> 27:52.560
can I help you?

27:53.740 --> 27:55.360
One single room, please.

27:58.120 --> 28:00.120
Wake her up and have her check in herself.

28:02.040 --> 28:03.300
She's sick.

28:03.340 --> 28:05.000
Can I register first?

28:05.040 --> 28:06.380
Once she wakes up,

28:06.420 --> 28:08.100
I'll bring her down.

28:10.040 --> 28:11.920
Isn't she your girlfriend?

28:14.820 --> 28:16.580
She is…my girlfriend.

28:17.840 --> 28:19.380
Then please wake her up.

28:19.420 --> 28:20.760
She needs to sign in herself.

28:37.940 --> 28:39.320
I had a dream

28:39.820 --> 28:41.420
back there.

28:42.160 --> 28:43.520
In that dream,

28:44.580 --> 28:48.380
someone says I am his girlfriend.

28:48.420 --> 28:49.960
Who was that?

28:50.840 --> 28:53.620
Was that you, Jiang Qiaoxi?

28:57.080 --> 28:58.500
Dreams are the opposite of real life.

29:01.240 --> 29:02.720
The opposite?

29:02.760 --> 29:04.820
So does that mean

29:04.860 --> 29:07.500
I'm actually your boyfriend?

29:09.100 --> 29:11.300
If you've got energy, get down and walk.

29:13.040 --> 29:15.100
I'm dizzy.

29:23.920 --> 29:25.820
Jiang Qiaoxi, you know something?

29:26.880 --> 29:29.220
A senior in my dorm at university

29:29.260 --> 29:30.920
taught me how to do makeup.

29:30.960 --> 29:33.580
Now I can blend eyeshadow,

29:33.620 --> 29:35.260
add blush,

29:35.300 --> 29:36.900
even do mascara.

29:37.520 --> 29:38.660
But

29:39.240 --> 29:40.800
I've never used

29:40.840 --> 29:41.980
the lipstick

29:42.020 --> 29:43.480
and those heels you gave me.

29:43.980 --> 29:45.820
Because I kept thinking
about what you said.

29:46.440 --> 29:48.080
That you didn't want to miss

29:48.120 --> 29:49.680
my first time in lipstick and heels.

29:49.720 --> 29:50.820
Yingtao.

29:52.360 --> 29:53.440
That's enough.

29:54.600 --> 29:56.560
No, it's not. I need to say it.

29:57.060 --> 29:58.160
I need to say it.

29:58.200 --> 30:00.280
Jiang Qiaoxi, you drive me crazy.

30:00.320 --> 30:01.480
You're selfish.

30:01.520 --> 30:02.580
You lied to me.

30:03.080 --> 30:04.240
You pushed me away.

30:05.080 --> 30:06.320
You didn't believe in me.

30:06.820 --> 30:10.140
And still… I don't hate you.

30:10.180 --> 30:12.780
Because I know deep down,
you wanted come to me and be there for me.

30:13.380 --> 30:15.000
Just like when you were a kid,

30:15.900 --> 30:17.680
trying to find your way back to Qunshan.

30:29.320 --> 30:30.500
Yingtao…

30:32.800 --> 30:34.500
I can barely keep my life together.

30:35.820 --> 30:37.140
How could I be there for you?

30:39.140 --> 30:41.340
That's why I came.

30:42.920 --> 30:44.120
Jiang Qiaoxi.

30:46.220 --> 30:47.400
Don't be scared.

30:48.980 --> 30:50.160
I found you.

32:11.780 --> 32:12.720
Watch out.

32:51.880 --> 32:52.780
Where are you going?

32:53.540 --> 32:54.880
Just getting some water.

33:29.060 --> 33:32.800
KEUNG KEE STORE

34:03.420 --> 34:04.900
Take your meds now.

34:04.940 --> 34:06.860
Then again at eleven tonight.

34:10.520 --> 34:11.540
I want to shower.

34:13.320 --> 34:15.440
I'm all sweaty. It's gross.

34:20.880 --> 34:21.880
Okay.

34:50.179 --> 34:51.060
Where are you going now?

34:53.639 --> 34:55.120
Hang tight. I'll be right back.

35:32.920 --> 35:34.180
Shower's ready.

35:41.520 --> 35:42.780
Um…

35:43.280 --> 35:45.760
Hot water on the left, cold on the right.

35:49.920 --> 35:51.280
You can put your clothes there.

35:54.580 --> 35:55.660
I'll, um, wait outside.

36:36.360 --> 36:37.540
The door lock's broken.

36:38.760 --> 36:40.340
I'll call someone to fix it.

36:40.380 --> 36:41.740
How long will that take?

36:43.080 --> 36:44.320
Could be a while.

36:51.100 --> 36:53.420
Then can you just stay out there
and keep watch?

36:53.460 --> 36:54.680
I won't take long.

36:55.880 --> 36:56.780
Sure.

36:56.820 --> 36:58.240
Take your time.

36:58.280 --> 36:59.500
I'll be right here.

37:34.180 --> 37:35.100
Jiang Qiaoxi.

37:37.020 --> 37:38.140
Yeah?

37:38.180 --> 37:39.560
Nothing.

37:39.600 --> 37:41.000
Just checking you're still there.

37:42.640 --> 37:43.660
I'm not going anywhere.

37:54.300 --> 37:55.580
Jiang Qiaoxi.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.440
Hmm?

37:58.940 --> 37:59.940
Never mind.

39:11.780 --> 39:12.960
You done?

39:24.500 --> 39:26.300
Your body wash smells nice.

39:28.400 --> 39:29.700
Just something I grabbed.

39:31.160 --> 39:32.940
It's the same smell I noticed

39:33.440 --> 39:35.160
when you were carrying me earlier.

39:45.500 --> 39:47.020
I'm done.

39:47.060 --> 39:48.480
You go shower now.

39:50.600 --> 39:51.680
Me?

39:56.280 --> 39:58.800
You're not gonna shower
after running around all day?

40:51.200 --> 40:52.220
You finished freshening up?

40:57.000 --> 40:58.880
You look like…

41:01.520 --> 41:03.000
the you back in high school.

41:10.860 --> 41:12.640
I wasn't this tan back then.

41:13.220 --> 41:15.100
But when I look into your eyes…

41:17.540 --> 41:19.620
I still see that same you.

41:25.360 --> 41:26.840
That was…

41:30.020 --> 41:31.440
a long time ago.

41:31.480 --> 41:32.980
It's been what, two years?

41:33.540 --> 41:34.740
That's not long at all.

41:48.100 --> 41:49.460
Tell me…

41:52.340 --> 41:53.620
what really happened…

41:56.160 --> 41:57.620
these past two years?

42:05.080 --> 42:06.280
Yingtao,

42:06.780 --> 42:07.960
get some rest.

42:08.000 --> 42:09.780
I'm right in front of you.

42:09.820 --> 42:11.620
And you're still not gonna tell me?

42:27.560 --> 42:28.580
You're not feeling well.

42:30.020 --> 42:31.540
You need to rest up.

42:54.220 --> 42:55.320
Don't go.

45:11.180 --> 45:13.620
Subtitle translation by: Jiaxin Wang
